{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/573832-mixing-my-to-do-hunter-group-list","id":573832,"title":"Mixing my \"To Do\" hunter group list","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-30T06:01:03-07:00","id":573832,"title":"Mixing my \"To Do\" hunter group list","content":"Some time ago, I've decided that instead of waiting for a cannon or an homebrewer to make the groups I would like to see I should start doing so myself. I order to do so, I've made myself a number &quot;To Do&quot; lists for future ideas- one list to &quot;specific target&quot; groups, one for &quot;dark mirror&quot; groups, one for &quot;Ascension translation&quot; groups, one for &quot;antagonist specific&quot; groups, one for &quot;Vigilant Times&quot; groups and one for &quot;regional powers&quot; groups. The first and the last are kinds obvious- the first is about the regular Night Stalkers/Witch Finders/Spirit Slayers/Mortal Remains format and the last is about hunters who come from Regional and Great Powers from around the world. The second is about creating a Slashing Conspiracies who are devoted to killing in the way the regular groups work to protect humanity. The third is meant to convert Ascension's secret societies (Traditions, Conventions and Crafts) as Conspiracies. The fourth is about groups in the style of the first list, but who hunt the more &quot;evil&quot; monsters, which means they may work together with the more &quot;human&quot; ones- strixs, idigams, spirits, abyssal horrors, etc. Finally, Vigilant Times is a project which is meant to similar to Ancient Bloodlines/Mysteries, only for Hunter instead of Vampire- an historic setting which gives all kind of new options.<br /> <br /> As you may see, 6 lists is a bit too much for anyone to handle, and while working on the first list I've found that some of my groups already overlap between the lists, so I've thought that it would be easier to look which hunter groups I could also mix together!<br /> <br /> so now, here are the free slots and the combinations I've thought about-<br /> <br /> <b><u>Combinations</u></b><br /> Night Stalkers- Requiem for the Regina- Navalon<br /> Changing Breeds- Madzimbabwe- Mutapan Empire<br /> Etemenaki- Thailand<br /> *LM- Golden Age of Piracy<br /> *FoS- South Korea- Toc Faan<br /> KoSA- Russian Revolution<br /> *Otodo- Brazil- Church of the Sun<br /> *Seers- Celestial Masters- Dust Bowl<br /> *OoLS- Aided- Wars of Scottish Independence<br /> *Geist Antagonists- Pomegrante Deme- Black Death<br /> Heroes- Musketeers<br /> Ahl i Batin- Saudi Arabia<br /> Kisarfi- Fall of Istanbul- Turkey<br /> *Valdaermen- Vikings<br /> Wu Lung- Three Kingdoms China- China<br /> *Kopa Loei- God's Own Country<br /> Children of Isis- Ruins of Empire<br /> Ngoma- South Africa<br /> Taftani- Zoroastrianism- To the Strongest- Iran<br /> Grimm Brothers- Germany<br /> *Divine Artificer- Doubting Souls<br /> Roanoke- Thunder Society<br /> *Ethiopia- Celestial Chorus<br /> Deceived- Morocco- Ruins of Empire<br /> Akashic Brotherhood- Indonesia<br /> London Blitz- To Ho Lai<br /> Taoist Alchemists- Three Kingdoms China<br /> *Jazz Age Requiem-Bataa<br /> Sami necromancers- Sons of Tengri<br /> Hollow Ones- 30 Years War<br /> Dreamspeakers- Serpent and the Rainbow<br /> On the Orient Express- Iteration X<br /> Wild West<br /> American Revolutionary War- Sons of Ether<br /> *Year Without Summer- cold ones","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 09-09-2017, 06:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-30T06:23:46-07:00","id":573859,"title":"","content":"The Heirs of the Crown interest me. Can you give some details, if you are working on them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-30T08:43:03-07:00","id":574003,"title":"","content":"I'm going to post the Nimrod Movement first and expand the Cage of Shadows into a darker form (and maybe adding some Aki Ten material for WWII), but I do have a concept for them- they were first founded during the Dark Ages and were chased by the Church during the Spanish Inquisition, being seen as heretics. I think they are going to absorb some of the features of the Circle of Red as a group of demonologists who use their dark side in order to transcend it- a mirror to the &quot;Dark MM&quot; who claim to be righteous, but commit terrible sins. Their Endowment is based around summoning one of the 72 demons, each being a 1-5 power who grants them some sort of bonus or special ability. They claim that those demons are simply their own dark personalities taking form, and that Hell is simply the manifestation of all the sins made by mankind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-30T16:43:27-07:00","id":574472,"title":"","content":"You're gonna port over the Wu Nung, but not willing to throw in the Hem-Ka Sobk as a renegade Scorpion Cult that destroys Relics in order to return magic to the source? For shame!<br /> <br /> I'd love to see your Jazz Age Requiem pitch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-30T17:02:40-07:00","id":574483,"title":"","content":"I clicked this hoping to see the an Ashwood Abbey's member's plans for the next few months.<br /> <br /> Unsubscribe, dislike.<br /> <br /> (I do