h I would hate myself after the test :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T15:32:43-07:00","id":620639,"title":"","content":"Are you still working on the list?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T22:35:20-07:00","id":620925,"title":"","content":"yes, but I need to finish my tests first :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T06:56:18-07:00","id":623271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/573832-mixing-my-to-do-hunter-group-list?p=582452#post582452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Why would it? Magic magicians have a long and respectable history; Dungeons and Dragons bard class is probably the most obvious example.<br /> <br /> Making them jazz musicians rather than Welsh luteists seems like a minor detail. I certainly can't think of any sterotype based around magical jazz musicians.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are no offensive caricatures to do with D&amp;D bards that have a lot to do with irl, whereas the magical jazz guy is one of those dehumanizing genre conventions that we've all seen before in some form. It's from this thing where black entertainers were expected be sexless, pleasant, wise and good in spite of entrenched prejudices: Magical Negros. Somebody said 'coonish', which is as good a word as any for it, honestly. There's also the persistent myth of black talent coming from supernatural sources/genetics rather than hard work or anything wholesome like that. Whether or not you think the character is informed by prejudice or exploitative, it kind of is. If they could be magical Welsh Luteists rather than magical black guys who hearin that pulse (lord have mercy etc), then make them magical Welsh Luteists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7249-chope","name":"Chope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T07:33:04-07:00","id":623286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/573832-mixing-my-to-do-hunter-group-list?p=623271#post623271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are no offensive caricatures to do with D&amp;D bards that have a lot to do with irl, whereas the magical jazz guy is one of those dehumanizing genre conventions that we've all seen before in some form. It's from this thing where black entertainers were expected be sexless, pleasant, wise and good in spite of entrenched prejudices: Magical Negros. Somebody said 'coonish', which is as good a word as any for it, honestly. There's also the persistent myth of black talent coming from supernatural sources/genetics rather than hard work or anything wholesome like that. Whether or not you think the character is informed by prejudice or exploitative, it kind of is. If they could be magical Welsh Luteists rather than magical black guys who hearin that pulse (lord have mercy etc), then make them magical Welsh Luteists.</div> </div> </div> </div>so you are saying there should never be a compact or a conspiracy based around a none white culture?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T07:52:07-07:00","id":623296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/573832-mixing-my-to-do-hunter-group-list?p=623286#post623286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so you are saying there should never be a compact or a conspiracy based around a none white culture?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I believe his point is not ones based on specific abused racial tropes with loaded histories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T08:13:47-07:00","id":623319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/573832-mixing-my-to-do-hunter-group-list?p=623286#post623286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so you are saying there should never be a compact or a conspiracy based around a none white culture?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a really strange takeaway. What I'm saying is that there's nuanced, incendiary racial context in play, which somebody dismissed with an aside about D&amp;D bards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7249-chope","name":"Chope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T08:17:38-07:00","id":623330,"title":"","content":"like I've said before, I have never heard about a stereotype connected to a &quot;magical black jazz musicians&quot;, and I don't see why afro americans can't be the first people to discover a special technique connected to music. The special thing about the group's Endowment is their music, not the colour of their skin, their gender or anything similar to that. White people can (and do!) join the compact, just like that there are white jazz musicians. Basing a magical technique around a certain style of music (which is built around older styles mixed with new ideas) is something which I can't see how it should be offensive- at least, not more than giving christian priests the ability to wield holy powers. In sort, I am going to write this group, and I am going to do it carefully, just like I try to do the rest of my homebrew. If the complete writeup would still contain a few stereotypes (for I am a human being), I'll be more than glad to get feedback about how to develop them better and fix them. The other option would be writing only white groups, and I find this a bit boring.<br /> <br /> And about Welsh Lustiest- while I didn't made such a group, I did wrote a group French Opera Singers. I simply like music, and just as there could be more than one type of religious hunters, there could be more than one type of musician hunters. Also- challenge accepted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T08:38:19-07:00","id":623348,"title":"","content":"If you've never heard of these stereotypes and the social context they existed/mutated/persist in or the connotations that this topic comes brings, then it sounds as though you have a lot of research ahead of you. The comparison between this and the MM having access to magic* seems kind of disingenuous; black cultural expression and organized religion aren't subject to the same stigma -- they certainly don't enjoy the same agency of definition &amp; social power. I don't think that white-washing the compact would help either.<br /> <br /> *It isn't unusual or damaging for the Church to claim miracles. After all, their narrative is that anything is possible through Christ. It's far murkier with jazz music and themes of cultural appropriation and racial subjugation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7249-chope","name":"Chope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T13:33:17-07:00","id":623626,"title":"","content":"Gods own country is Yorkshire right? <br /> <br /> in all seriousness huge number of ideas, very impressive","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Didn't anyone ever tell you not to bring claws to a gun fight?</span></b><br /><br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3786-leicsfox","name":"LeicsFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3786_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T14:13:26-07:00","id":630245,"title":"","content":"few new ideas I've thought about from the list-<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1048850-mori-kage-conspiracy-dream-catchers\">Mori Kage</a>-</b> a clan of assassins originated from ancient Japan who use the Echo in order to create replicas of themselves after making an ages old pact with a court of great yokai. Their part of the deal is to hunt down escaped &quot;pets&quot; of the yokai and the false selves they leave behind.<br /> <b>Kopa Loei</b>- priests and shamans from Polynesia who possess Mana and use their authority and influence over the world in order to maintain the balance between the living and the dead while seeking after the wisdom of their ancestors.<br /> <b>Valdaermen-</b> originating from the wild warriors of ancient Scandinavia, they are a mostly male group who use the gift of their witches and shamans to inscribe magical runes to their weapons in order to continue the ancient tradition of fighting against the monsters as a test for themselves.<br /> <b>Church of the Sun</b>- carriers of a noble and divine lineage of once pagan group, they now style themselves after angels and saints while using their gift in order to banish evil and protect their land.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/763228-shepherds-of-annwn-grave-robbers\"><b>Shepherds of Annwn</b></a>- continuing the myth of the Cwn Annwn, that small compact who seek to banish the dark hounds after a years old tragedy and use a combination of blood magic and druidic rites.<br /> <b>Crystal Watchers-</b> a group who serve a primordial force of nature which seeks to bring stasis and perfection to the world through freezing everything in place, and gain the gift of immortality in exchange for snuffing the Divine Fire<br /> <b>Euthothanos</b>- executors who style themselves as angels of death and seek to cut free the miserable from the world while still having a human form- while making sure that the dead would stay dead<br /> <b>Celestial Chorus</b>- people who use holy relics in order to transform their body into divine beings, which use their new powers in order to protect sacred artifacts through the world from being abused by monsters<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/635649-custodes-ignis-vigil-for-rome\"><b>Custodes Ignis</b></a>- originating from ancient Rome, they use a special ceremony in order to connect themselves to the Furnace, an old power who makes them more than human by scorching divine tattoos to their flesh<br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/692793-conspiracy-order-of-the-void\">Order of the Nameless</a>-</b> an occult order of gentlemen who have put themselves a goal to take over the Void and reshape the world in their own image.<br /> <b>Toc Faan-</b> a cannibal cult which hunts down people with &quot;special spark&quot; and devour them in the name of their demon gods, and use those sparks to fuel their terrible gifts<br /> <b>Aided</b>- necromancers from the British Islands who bind dead souls to their will by using a forbidden tradition of the druids who mutilate both the spirit and the body of their victims.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/702623-the-apollonian-priesthood-covenant\"><b>Apollonian Priesthood-</b></a> a cult of sun worshipers who believe in the perfection of masculinity and guide people through their visions toward individual refinement.<br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/703857-the-zmei-initiative-into-the-cold\">ZMEI</a>-</b> if Valkyrie is Shield and the Architects are Hydra, here comes Leviathan! those psychics use the distilled essence of a captured test subject in order to enhance their minds. There is also some Leviathan: the Tempest connection in here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 02-14-2017, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-08T14:23:06-07:00","id":694195,"title":"","content":"So- I'm about to return to the University soon, and I wondered if there is any group in here you would have liked to see before my degree would try to kill me again :P I'm also adding to the list something in the style of Pandemonium Club/Enterprise, which would be a kind of Cancer Conspiracy.","signatu